# Qwertymates iOS App Store (do not re-break accepted conditions)

**Owner policy — same class as school gallery, food WhatsApp, deploy-after-changes.** Qwertymates iOS (`com.qwertymates.app`, ASC `6798004708`) was **accepted** after multiple App Review rejections. Future iOS enhancements **must not** undo the gates that got the app approved.

**Android / web may keep** creator tips and Facebook-ingested TV. **iOS must stay gated.** Do **not** “optimize away” `Platform.OS === "ios"` App Review flags.

**Out of scope:** Huawei AppGallery is a separate track — do not mix that work into iOS App Store changes.

## After every Cursor update or rules reset

Confirm this file exists with **`alwaysApply: true`**. Indexed from `.cursor/rules/recurring-owner-schedules.mdc`. If missing, restore from git.

## Agent checklist — before changing `mobile/**` that ships on iOS

Check this table **before** changing UI, payments, TV, tips, screenshots, tracking, auth, or privacy:

| Guideline | Keep (do not break) |
|-----------|---------------------|
| **Privacy / tracking** | Tracking = **No** unless owner + ASC App Privacy + ATT are fully aligned. Do not add IDFA, ATT, AdSupport, or ad/MMP SDKs casually. Binary `usesIdfa: false`. No `NSUserTrackingUsageDescription`. |
| **3.1.1 Payments** | No iOS IAP circumvention. **Hide creator tips / Buy me Coffee / donate-via-wallet for digital content on iOS only.** Do not re-enable tipping, coffee, or “pay outside App Store” for digital content on iOS. Physical goods (QwertyHub, food, grocery) and P2P Scan-QR send (3.1.1(b)) may stay. Do not invent new wallet charges for digital features on iOS. |
| **5.2.3 IP / third-party AV** | Do **not** ship Facebook-ingested TV / YouTube / Spotify / SoundCloud / third-party AV catalogs on iOS. Keep the iOS filter. Don’t add scraped/ingested third-party video to the iOS catalog. |
| **2.3.10 Metadata** | Screenshots = **iOS device chrome only** (no Android status bars). Captions: **ACBPay Wallet** (not AGBFryWallet). Listing copy must match the binary. |
| **2.1 / 2.3** | Don’t submit incomplete features, placeholder content, or misleading screenshots. |
| **5.1.1 Data** | Privacy policy URL must stay accurate (`https://www.qwertymates.com/policies/privacy-policy`). Don’t collect new data types without updating ASC App Privacy. Keep in-app **Delete my account**. |
| **Login / account** | Auth is email / username / phone OTP today. **If other social logins are added, Sign in with Apple is required** on iOS. |

Wrong Tracking=Yes labels previously caused **5.1.2** rejection (privacy-only fix; no new binary). Do not mark data “Used for Tracking” or “Third-Party Advertising” unless those SDKs actually ship.

