```typescript
// ✅ KEEP — iOS hides digital tips; Android/web keep them
export function iosCreatorDigitalTipsEnabled(): boolean {
  return Platform.OS !== "ios";
}

// ❌ BAD — re-enabling tips / Facebook TV on iOS
if (Platform.OS === "ios") { /* show Donate / Buy me Coffee */ }
if (Platform.OS === "ios") return true; // allow all TV including tv-fb- ingest
```

## Do / don’t

- **Do** keep iOS-only filters when adding new TV, status, music, or donate surfaces — call the helpers in `iosStoreCompliance.ts`; do not copy-paste a new ungated Donate button.
- **Do** use iOS-framed screenshots and **ACBPay Wallet** in ASC metadata / `backend/scripts/generateIosStoreGraphicsPacks.mjs`.
- **Don’t** add StoreKit-bypass wallet paywalls for digital unlocks, subscriptions, or creator services on iOS (IAP required if those ship on iOS later).
- **Don’t** submit iOS while features are placeholders or screenshots show Android chrome.
